# Cloudflare Pages SPA fallback (_redirects)
#
# Every unmatched path serves index.html with a 200 so client-side routing
# works on the edge CDN: deep links, refreshes, and paths the React app owns
# (e.g. /projects/<id>) never hit a 404. Hashed assets under /assets/* are
# real files and are matched before this catch-all.
#
# Order matters: Cloudflare applies the FIRST matching rule, so this
# catch-all sits last. See https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/serving-pages/
/* /index.html 200
